---
/**
 * A binary star on the sky: both stars go round their common centre of mass, and the centre of mass drifts across
 * the sky uniformly (proper motion), so the stars draw waves and loops. Bessel's puzzle: with the companion hidden,
 * only Sirius A and its wavy path are seen. Physics: circular orbits about the centre of mass, r₁/r₂ = m₂/m₁, one
 * period T = √(a³/(m₁ + m₂)) (а.е., years, solar masses). Real Sirius numbers: m₁ = 2,06, a = 19,78 а.е. (7,50″ at
 * 2,64 пк), proper motion 1,34″ per year = 3,53 а.е. per year. The swing is shown EXAG times larger relative to the
 * drift (stated in the caption); time runs at YEARS_PER_S model years per second.
 */
---

<figure class="bin not-content" data-bin>
	<div class="bin__stage">
		<svg class="bin__sky" role="img" aria-label="Двойная звезда движется по небу: обе звезды обращаются вокруг общего центра масс">
			<g class="bin__bg" data-bg></g>
			<path class="bin__cm-path" data-cm-path d=""></path>
			<path class="bin__trail bin__trail--b" data-trail-b d=""></path>
			<path class="bin__trail bin__trail--a" data-trail-a d=""></path>
			<line class="bin__link" data-link x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="0"></line>
			<g class="bin__part" data-cm>
				<circle class="bin__hit" r="14"></circle>
				<path class="bin__cm" d="M -6 0 H 6 M 0 -6 V 6"></path>
				<circle class="bin__cm-dot" r="2"></circle>
			</g>
			<g class="bin__part" data-b>
				<circle class="bin__hit" r="14"></circle>
				<circle class="bin__glow bin__glow--b" r="6"></circle>
				<circle class="bin__star bin__star--b" r="2.4"></circle>
			</g>
			<g class="bin__part" data-a>
				<circle class="bin__hit" r="16"></circle>
				<circle class="bin__glow bin__glow--a" r="12"></circle>
				<circle class="bin__star bin__star--a" r="5"></circle>
			</g>
			<text class="bin__label bin__label--a" data-label-a>Сириус A</text>
			<text class="bin__label bin__label--b" data-label-b>Сириус B</text>
			<g class="bin__legend" data-legend-cm>
				<path class="bin__cm" d="M -5 0 H 5 M 0 -5 V 5"></path>
				<line class="bin__cm-path" x1="10" y1="0" x2="34" y2="0"></line>
				<text class="bin__label bin__label--cm" x="40" y="4">центр масс и его путь</text>
			</g>
		</svg>
		<p class="bin__years" data-years></p>
	</div>
	<div class="bin__controls">
		<div class="bin__toggles">
			<label class="bin__check"><input type="checkbox" data-show-b /> Показать спутник</label>
			<label class="bin__check"><input type="checkbox" data-show-cm /> Центр масс</label>
		</div>
		<label class="bin__slider">
			<span>Масса спутника: <output data-m2-out></output></span>
			<input type="range" min="0.21" max="2.06" step="0.01" value="1.02" data-m2 aria-label="Масса спутника в массах Солнца" />
		</label>
		<div class="bin__chips" role="group" aria-label="Примеры">
			<button type="button" class="bin__chip" data-preset="1.02">Сириус</button>
			<button type="button" class="bin__chip" data-preset="2.06">Равные массы</button>
		</div>
	</div>
	<dl class="bin__stats">
		<div><dt>Расстояния до центра масс</dt><dd data-ratio></dd><dd class="bin__sub" data-radii></dd></div>
		<div><dt>Период обращения</dt><dd data-period></dd><dd class="bin__sub" data-sum></dd></div>
	</dl>
	<figcaption class="bin__caption">
		Вид на небо. Числа настоящие: масса Сириуса A 2,06 массы Солнца, расстояние между звёздами 19,8 а.е., пара
		смещается по небу на 1,34″ в год. Размах колебаний по сравнению со смещением увеличен в 3 раза, иначе волну
		было бы трудно разглядеть. Орбиты в модели — окружности, видимые плашмя; на самом деле орбита Сириуса B —
		вытянутый эллипс, и мы видим её наклонно. Время ускорено: 10 лет за секунду.
	</figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
	.bin {
		margin-block: 2rem;
		padding: 0.75rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
		border-radius: 1rem;
		background: var(--ig-surface);
	}
	.bin i {
		font-family: var(--ig-font-math);
	}
	.bin__stage {
		position: relative;
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: #02030a;
		aspect-ratio: 9 / 4;
	}
	.bin__sky {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		touch-action: manipulation;
	}
	.bin__years {
		position: absolute;
		left: 0.8rem;
		top: 0.5rem;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		color: #ffe9b0;
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
		pointer-events: none;
		text-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9);
	}
	.bin__bg circle {
		fill: rgb(225 232 255 / 0.75);
	}
	.bin__trail {
		fill: none;
		stroke-width: 1.6;
		stroke-linecap: round;
		stroke-linejoin: round;
	}
	.bin__trail--a {
		stroke: rgb(150 195 255 / 0.85);
	}
	.bin__trail--b {
		stroke: rgb(255 170 120 / 0.85);
	}
	.bin__cm-path {
		fill: none;
		stroke: rgb(255 233 176 / 0.7);
		stroke-width: 1.2;
		stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
	}
	.bin__link {
		stroke: rgb(235 238 255 / 0.35);
		stroke-width: 1;
	}
	.bin__cm {
		stroke: #ffe9b0;
		stroke-width: 1.6;
	}
	.bin__cm-dot {
		fill: #ffe9b0;
	}
	.bin__hit {
		fill: transparent;
	}
	.bin__star--a {
		fill: #f2f6ff;
	}
	.bin__glow--a {
		fill: rgb(170 205 255 / 0.3);
	}
	.bin__star--b {
		fill: #fff;
	}
	.bin__glow--b {
		fill: rgb(255 190 150 / 0.35);
	}
	.bin__part {
		cursor: help;
		outline: none;
	}
	.bin__part.is-hl .bin__glow,
	.bin__part:focus-visible .bin__glow,
	.bin__part.is-hl .bin__hit,
	.bin__part:focus-visible .bin__hit {
		stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
		stroke-width: 1.5;
	}
	.bin__label {
		font-size: 12px;
		font-family: var(--sl-font);
		fill: rgb(235 238 255 / 0.92);
		pointer-events: none;
		paint-order: stroke;
		stroke: #02030a;
		stroke-width: 3px;
		stroke-linejoin: round;
	}
	.bin__label--b {
		fill: #ffd2b5;
	}
	.bin__label--cm {
		fill: #ffe9b0;
	}
	.bin__nw {
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	.bin__controls {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
	}
	.bin__toggles {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
	}
	.bin__check {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.4rem;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
		cursor: pointer;
	}
	.bin__check input {
		accent-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
		width: 1.05rem;
		height: 1.05rem;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.bin__slider {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.2rem;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
	.bin__slider output {
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
	}
	.bin__slider input {
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0;
		accent-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
	}
	.bin__chips {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.35rem;
	}
	.bin__chip {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
		font: inherit;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
		background: transparent;
		border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4);
		border-radius: 999px;
		cursor: pointer;
	}
	.bin__chip:hover {
		border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
	}
	.bin__chip[aria-pressed='true'] {
		border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
		background: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
	}
	.bin :is(button, input):focus-visible {
		outline: 2px solid var(--sl-color-accent);
		outline-offset: 2px;
	}
	.bin__stats {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 0.4rem;
		margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
	}
	.bin__stats > div {
		padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
		border-radius: 0.6rem;
		background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
	}
	.bin__stats dt {
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	.bin__stats dd {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-base);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
	}
	.bin__stats dd.bin__sub {
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
		line-height: 1.45;
	}
	.bin__caption {
		margin-top: 0.6rem;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	@media (max-width: 40rem) {
		.bin {
			padding: 0.5rem;
		}
		.bin__stage {
			aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
		}
		.bin__stats {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>

<script>
	import { fmt, prng } from './util';

	const M1 = 2.06; // Sirius A, solar masses (Bond et al. 2017)
	const M2_SIRIUS = 1.02; // Sirius B
	const A_AU = 19.78; // separation: 7,50″ at 2,637 пк
	const V_AU = 3.53; // proper motion 1,339″/год × 2,637 пк, а.е. per year
	const EXAG = 3; // the swing is shown 3 times larger relative to the drift
	const YEARS_PER_S = 10;
	const TILT = (5 * Math.PI) / 180; // the drift goes slightly downwards
	const SVGNS = 'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';

	type NoteEl = SVGGElement & { igNote?: () => Node; click?: () => void };

	const yearsWord = (n: number) => {
		const m10 = n % 10;
		const m100 = n % 100;
		if (m100 >= 11 && m100 <= 14) return 'лет';
		if (m10 === 1) return 'год';
		if (m10 >= 2 && m10 <= 4) return 'года';
		return 'лет';
	};
	const SUN = 'M<sub>☉</sub>';

	for (const root of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-bin]')) {
		const q = <T extends Element>(sel: string) => root.querySelector<T>(sel)!;
		const svg = q<SVGSVGElement>('.bin__sky');
		const stage = q<HTMLElement>('.bin__stage');
		const bg = q<SVGGElement>('[data-bg]');
		const cmPath = q<SVGPathElement>('[data-cm-path]');
		const trailA = q<SVGPathElement>('[data-trail-a]');
		const trailB = q<SVGPathElement>('[data-trail-b]');
		const link = q<SVGLineElement>('[data-link]');
		const gA = q<NoteEl>('[data-a]');
		const gB = q<NoteEl>('[data-b]');
		const gCM = q<NoteEl>('[data-cm]');
		const labelA = q<SVGTextElement>('[data-label-a]');
		const labelB = q<SVGTextElement>('[data-label-b]');
		const legendCM = q<SVGGElement>('[data-legend-cm]');
		const yearsOut = q<HTMLElement>('[data-years]');
		const showB = q<HTMLInputElement>('[data-show-b]');
		const showCM = q<HTMLInputElement>('[data-show-cm]');
		const m2In = q<HTMLInputElement>('[data-m2]');
		const m2Out = q<HTMLOutputElement>('[data-m2-out]');
		const ratioOut = q<HTMLElement>('[data-ratio]');
		const radiiOut = q<HTMLElement>('[data-radii]');
		const periodOut = q<HTMLElement>('[data-period]');
		const sumOut = q<HTMLElement>('[data-sum]');
		const chips = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-preset]'));

		let W = 0;
		let H = 0;
		let aPx = 0; // the separation on screen
		let vPx = 0; // drift, px per model year
		let x0 = 0; // where the centre of mass starts
		let y0 = 0;
		let t = 0; // model years since the trails started
		let theta = -Math.PI / 2; // A starts above the centre of mass
		let samples: { t: number; th: number }[] = [];
		let raf = 0;
		let last = 0;

		const m2 = () => Number(m2In.value);
		const period = () => Math.sqrt(A_AU ** 3 / (M1 + m2()));
		const r1 = () => (A_AU * m2()) / (M1 + m2()); // а.е.
		const r2 = () => (A_AU * M1) / (M1 + m2());
		const isSirius = () => Math.abs(m2() - M2_SIRIUS) < 0.005;

		const cmAt = (tt: number) => ({ x: x0 + vPx * tt * Math.cos(TILT), y: y0 + vPx * tt * Math.sin(TILT) });
		const posAt = (tt: number, th: number) => {
			const c = cmAt(tt);
			const k = aPx / A_AU;
			const ux = Math.cos(th);
			const uy = Math.sin(th);
			return {
				c,
				a: { x: c.x + r1() * k * ux, y: c.y + r1() * k * uy },
				b: { x: c.x - r2() * k * ux, y: c.y - r2() * k * uy },
			};
		};

		/** The pair enters at the left edge again, with fresh trails. */
		const restart = () => {
			t = 0;
			theta = -Math.PI / 2;
			x0 = 0.1 * W;
			y0 = H / 2 - 0.4 * W * Math.tan(TILT);
			samples = [{ t, th: theta }];
		};

		const geometry = () => {
			const r = stage.getBoundingClientRect();
			const nW = Math.max(1, Math.round(r.width));
			const nH = Math.max(1, Math.round(r.height));
			if (nW === W && nH === H) return;
			const c = W ? cmAt(t) : null;
			const fx = c ? c.x / W : 0;
			const fy = c ? c.y / H : 0;
			W = nW;
			H = nH;
			svg.setAttribute('viewBox', `0 0 ${W} ${H}`);
			legendCM.setAttribute('transform', `translate(14 ${H - 14})`);
			// the widest swing (the lightest companion: 0,91 a) must fit above and below the tilted path
			const fit = (H / 2 - 0.5 * W * Math.tan(TILT) - 20) / 0.91;
			aPx = Math.max(20, Math.min(0.16 * W, fit));
			vPx = ((aPx / A_AU) * V_AU) / EXAG;
			// the background stars
			const rnd = prng(7);
			const n = Math.round((W * H) / 2200);
			bg.replaceChildren(
				...Array.from({ length: n }, () => {
					const s = document.createElementNS(SVGNS, 'circle');
					s.setAttribute('cx', (rnd() * W).toFixed(1));
					s.setAttribute('cy', (rnd() * H).toFixed(1));
					s.setAttribute('r', (0.4 + rnd() ** 3 * 1.1).toFixed(2));
					s.setAttribute('opacity', (0.35 + rnd() * 0.6).toFixed(2));
					return s;
				}),
			);
			if (c) {
				// keep the place of the pair; the trails are redrawn in the new scale
				const old = samples;
				x0 = fx * W - vPx * t * Math.cos(TILT);
				y0 = fy * H - vPx * t * Math.sin(TILT);
				samples = old;
			} else restart();
		};

		const pathOf = (pts: { x: number; y: number }[]) =>
			pts.length < 2 ? '' : 'M' + pts.map((p) => `${p.x.toFixed(1)} ${p.y.toFixed(1)}`).join(' L');

		const placeLabel = (el: SVGTextElement, p: { x: number; y: number }, c: { x: number; y: number }, gap: number) => {
			let dx = p.x - c.x;
			let dy = p.y - c.y;
			const d = Math.hypot(dx, dy);
			if (d < 1) {
				dx = 0;
				dy = -1;
			} else {
				dx /= d;
				dy /= d;
			}
			const anchor = dx > 0.35 ? 'start' : dx < -0.35 ? 'end' : 'middle';
			// keep the label inside the frame
			const len = textLen(el);
			const left = anchor === 'start' ? 0 : anchor === 'end' ? len : len / 2;
			const x = Math.min(Math.max(p.x + dx * gap, left + 4), W - (len - left) - 4);
			const y = Math.min(Math.max(p.y + dy * gap + 4 + dy * 4, 14), H - 6);
			el.setAttribute('x', x.toFixed(1));
			el.setAttribute('y', y.toFixed(1));
			el.setAttribute('text-anchor', anchor);
		};
		const lens = new Map<string, number>();
		const textLen = (el: SVGTextElement) => {
			const key = el.textContent ?? '';
			if (!lens.has(key)) {
				const l = el.getComputedTextLength();
				if (l > 0) lens.set(key, l);
				return l || key.length * 6.5;
			}
			return lens.get(key)!;
		};

		const draw = () => {
			if (W < 40) return;
			const now = posAt(t, theta);
			const ptsA: { x: number; y: number }[] = [];
			const ptsB: { x: number; y: number }[] = [];
			for (const s of samples) {
				const p = posAt(s.t, s.th);
				ptsA.push(p.a);
				ptsB.push(p.b);
			}
			ptsA.push(now.a);
			ptsB.push(now.b);
			trailA.setAttribute('d', pathOf(ptsA));
			trailB.setAttribute('d', pathOf(ptsB));
			const c0 = cmAt(samples[0].t);
			cmPath.setAttribute('d', `M${c0.x.toFixed(1)} ${c0.y.toFixed(1)} L${now.c.x.toFixed(1)} ${now.c.y.toFixed(1)}`);
			gA.setAttribute('transform', `translate(${now.a.x.toFixed(1)} ${now.a.y.toFixed(1)})`);
			gB.setAttribute('transform', `translate(${now.b.x.toFixed(1)} ${now.b.y.toFixed(1)})`);
			gCM.setAttribute('transform', `translate(${now.c.x.toFixed(1)} ${now.c.y.toFixed(1)})`);
			link.setAttribute('x1', now.a.x.toFixed(1));
			link.setAttribute('y1', now.a.y.toFixed(1));
			link.setAttribute('x2', now.b.x.toFixed(1));
			link.setAttribute('y2', now.b.y.toFixed(1));
			placeLabel(labelA, now.a, now.c, 11);
			placeLabel(labelB, now.b, now.c, 8);
			const y = Math.floor(t);
			yearsOut.textContent = `прошло ${y} ${yearsWord(y)}`;
		};

		const step = (dt: number) => {
			const yrs = dt * YEARS_PER_S;
			t += yrs;
			theta += (2 * Math.PI * yrs) / period();
			const lastS = samples[samples.length - 1];
			if (theta - lastS.th > 0.04 || t - lastS.t > 0.5) samples.push({ t, th: theta });
			// both stars have left the frame: start again from the left
			const p = posAt(t, theta);
			if (Math.min(p.a.x, p.b.x) > W + 14) restart();
		};

		const frame = (now: number) => {
			const dt = Math.min((now - last) / 1000, 0.1);
			last = now;
			step(dt);
			draw();
			raf = requestAnimationFrame(frame);
		};

		const visibility = () => {
			const b = showB.checked;
			const c = showCM.checked;
			gB.style.display = b ? '' : 'none';
			trailB.style.display = b ? '' : 'none';
			labelB.style.display = b ? '' : 'none';
			link.style.display = b ? '' : 'none';
			gCM.style.display = c ? '' : 'none';
			cmPath.style.display = c ? '' : 'none';
			legendCM.style.display = c ? '' : 'none';
		};

		const readouts = () => {
			const m = m2();
			m2Out.innerHTML = `${fmt(m, 2)} ${SUN} = ${fmt(m / M1, 2)} <i>m</i><sub>1</sub>`;
			const k = M1 / m;
			ratioOut.innerHTML = `<i>r</i><sub>1</sub> : <i>r</i><sub>2</sub> = 1 : ${fmt(k, k < 9.995 ? 2 : 1)}`;
			radiiOut.innerHTML = `<i>r</i><sub>1</sub> = ${fmt(r1(), 1)} а.е., <i>r</i><sub>2</sub> = ${fmt(r2(), 1)} а.е.; <i>m</i><sub>1</sub><i>r</i><sub>1</sub> = <i>m</i><sub>2</sub><i>r</i><sub>2</sub>`;
			periodOut.innerHTML = `<i>T</i> = ${fmt(period(), 1)} года`;
			sumOut.innerHTML = `<i>m</i><sub>1</sub> + <i>m</i><sub>2</sub> = ${fmt(M1, 2)} + ${fmt(m, 2)} = ${fmt(M1 + m, 2)} ${SUN}, <i>a</i> = 19,8 а.е.; <span class="bin__nw"><i>T</i> = √(<i>a</i>³ / (<i>m</i><sub>1</sub> + <i>m</i><sub>2</sub>))</span>`;
			labelB.textContent = isSirius() ? 'Сириус B' : 'спутник';
			for (const ch of chips) ch.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(Math.abs(Number(ch.dataset.preset) - m) < 0.005));
		};

		// notes on the moving parts: they open on a tap or click only
		const note = (html: () => string) => () => {
			const el = document.createElement('span');
			el.innerHTML = html();
			return el;
		};
		const NOTES: [NoteEl, string, () => string][] = [
			[
				gA,
				'Сириус A',
				() =>
					'<b>Сириус A</b> — самая яркая звезда ночного неба, в 8,6 св. года от нас. Белая звезда главной последовательности: масса 2,06 массы Солнца, светимость в 25 раз больше солнечной.',
			],
			[
				gB,
				'Спутник',
				() =>
					isSirius()
						? '<b>Сириус B</b> — белый карлик: масса 1,02 массы Солнца, а размер почти как у Земли. Он почти в 10 000 раз слабее Сириуса A и теряется в его блеске, поэтому его так долго не видели.'
						: `<b>Спутник</b> массой ${fmt(m2(), 2)} массы Солнца. Чем он легче, тем ближе центр масс к Сириусу A и тем меньше Сириус A раскачивается.`,
			],
			[
				gCM,
				'Центр масс',
				() =>
					'<b>Центр масс</b> пары лежит на отрезке между звёздами и делит его в отношении <i>r</i><sub>1</sub> : <i>r</i><sub>2</sub> = <i>m</i><sub>2</sub> : <i>m</i><sub>1</sub>. Он летит по небу равномерно и по прямой, как будто звезда одна.',
			],
		];
		for (const [el, name, html] of NOTES) {
			el.dataset.note = '';
			el.dataset.noteTap = ''; // tap or click only: the stars move under a resting mouse
			el.igNote = note(html);
			// SVG elements have no click(); the keyboard handler of the notes calls it
			el.click = () => el.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('click', { bubbles: true }));
			el.setAttribute('tabindex', '0');
			el.setAttribute('role', 'button');
			el.setAttribute('aria-label', name);
			el.setAttribute('aria-haspopup', 'dialog');
			el.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
			el.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => el.classList.add('is-hl'));
			el.addEventListener('pointerleave', () => el.classList.remove('is-hl'));
		}

		showB.addEventListener('change', () => (visibility(), draw()));
		showCM.addEventListener('change', () => (visibility(), draw()));
		m2In.addEventListener('input', () => {
			restart();
			readouts();
			draw();
		});
		for (const ch of chips)
			ch.addEventListener('click', () => {
				m2In.value = ch.dataset.preset!;
				readouts();
				restart();
				draw();
			});

		geometry();
		visibility();
		readouts();
		draw();
		new ResizeObserver(() => {
			geometry();
			draw();
		}).observe(stage);
		// run only while the figure is on screen
		new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
			for (const en of entries) {
				cancelAnimationFrame(raf);
				if (en.isIntersecting) {
					last = performance.now();
					raf = requestAnimationFrame(frame);
				}
			}
		}).observe(root);
	}
</script>
